Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.47,0:01:55.57,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIn order for\NLuffy and Robin
Dialogue: 50,0:01:55.60,0:01:57.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,to get some rest and recover,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:57.30,0:01:58.74,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}the Going Merry\Nremained anchored off
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.77,0:02:01.34,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,the uninhabited\Nisland for four days.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.38,0:02:03.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,After that, we set sail.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.54,0:02:06.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Today marks the third morning since we\Nresumed our voyage.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.88,0:02:08.65,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,The weather is clear and sunny.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.61,0:02:11.31,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mostly spring, with occasional bouts of\Nsummer.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.70,0:02:18.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNami! Looook!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.39,0:02:26.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I made this potato paille
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.06,0:02:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,especially for you,\Nmademoiselle.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.30,0:02:30.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:32.42,0:02:34.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:34.46,0:02:36.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThat makes me so happy!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:36.93,0:02:37.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Keep it down, jerk!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:37.93,0:02:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some people are trying to sleep around\Nhere!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:40.21,0:02:41.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, cactus head.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:41.94,0:02:43.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My most sincere apologies.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.62,0:02:45.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What, you cigarette\Nsnorkeling dartboard?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.49,0:02:48.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHuh?\NWhat did you call me?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.06,0:02:50.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NDartboard. Dartboard eyebrows.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.90,0:02:51.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:53.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NLu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NLu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:56.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\N...ffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.09,0:02:56.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NLu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.62,0:02:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\N...ffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:02:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NLu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.62,0:02:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\N...ffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:02:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NLu...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.36,0:03:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– Whoo!\N– Whoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.46,0:03:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.93,0:03:07.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.03,0:03:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is me, frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughter]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.81,0:03:26.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't believe\Nthis is how he behaves
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:28.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,after almost freezing to death.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.82,0:03:30.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whataya think?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.74,0:03:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NYou nailed it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.61,0:03:34.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what you looked like!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.14,0:03:36.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NMake sure you\Nclean all that up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.41,0:03:38.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Kay! Hey Nami, is that food?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.38,0:03:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you eating?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.52,0:03:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some potato paille.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.05,0:03:44.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Potatoes, huh? I love potatoes!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.24,0:03:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Make me some!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.78,0:03:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just how many hours\Na day to you have
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.55,0:03:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to lie around and sleep, anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.15,0:03:50.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's none of your business!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll sleep as long as I like.\NWanna fight about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYou're still\Nrecuperating,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that hasn't slowed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:58.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,your appetite down in\Nthe slightest, has it?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.05,0:04:06.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So this is paille, huh?\NGood stuff!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.65,0:04:08.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is it called that?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.12,0:04:09.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because the meat is taken
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.86,0:04:12.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from the tail of the\Ngiant beast Paille.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.56,0:04:14.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should know.\NI was the one who killed it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.52,0:04:16.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was over 100 meters long!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.80,0:04:19.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! 100 meters?!\NThat's amazing, Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.46,0:04:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I did it all before breakfast.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.61,0:04:24.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWait, you\Nwoke up early to kill it?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.47,0:04:27.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper, have you forgotten who I am?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.51,0:04:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NOh! I get it!\NYou're Captain Us...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.54,0:04:34.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes! That's right! I am the\Ngreat and almighty Captain Uso...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.40,0:04:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NRobin!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.27,0:04:42.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NRobin! Good to see you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.54,0:04:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NRobin!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.72,0:04:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling okay?\NDo you still have a chill?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.85,0:04:49.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your treatment helped me out tremendously.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks! You're a\Nwonderful doctor!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.15,0:04:55.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calling me a wonderful doctor\Nwon't make me happy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.15,0:04:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or anything, you stupid jerk.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.42,0:04:58.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHe sure looks happy.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.18,0:04:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYep.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.89,0:05:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should take it easy, Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.33,0:05:01.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's already recovered enough
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.47,0:05:05.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to where he's running around\Nand screaming like an imbecile.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.20,0:05:07.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you can just relax and take your time.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.32,0:05:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.15,0:05:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a complement!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.52,0:05:10.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.74,0:05:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to make you something to\Nwarm you up?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.41,0:05:15.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you have an appetite?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.35,0:05:16.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.65,0:05:18.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,May I have some coffee, please?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.31,0:05:20.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NOf course! It's my pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:36.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.56,0:05:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.50,0:05:48.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, this paille\Nstuff is delicious!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.60,0:05:50.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stop eating it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.57,0:05:52.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.30,0:05:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet we could make some\Nmoney selling this stuff.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.47,0:05:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, come quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.83,0:05:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a... There's a\Nfrog doing the front crawl!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.57,0:05:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.66,0:06:01.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See for yourself!\NIt's headed to your side!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.86,0:06:02.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.93,0:06:04.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's that same frog we heard\Nabout.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.74,0:06:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.64,0:06:06.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you really\Ngonna take anything
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.56,0:06:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that goofy Admiral\Ntold you seriously?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.42,0:06:11.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way a frog\Nwould do the front crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:12.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's... HOLY CRAP!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.60,0:06:14.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,THERE'S A FROG DOING\NTHE FRONT CRAWL!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.73,0:06:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NCome on! After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO, USOPP, and CHOPPER]\N– Aye, aye!\N– Aye, aye!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.44,0:06:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NTake in the sail!\NStand by the oars!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.51,0:06:21.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring the ship\Nabout to 2 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:22.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO, USOPP, and CHOPPER]\N– Aye, aye!\N– Aye, aye!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.10,0:06:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.05,0:06:24.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI don't know why,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.07,0:06:26.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I get the feeling we\Nreally have to follow it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.04,0:06:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, mademoiselles.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uhh... what's happening?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.35,0:06:35.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...? What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.80,0:06:39.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems like the ship has changed its\Ncourse.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.53,0:06:42.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's the deal here?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.05,0:06:44.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd you change our course without asking\Nme?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.66,0:06:46.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami! You're never\Ngonna believe it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.47,0:06:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We found this huge frog\Nwith scars all over its body
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:50.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we're following it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.34,0:06:51.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A frog? What?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.82,0:06:52.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to catch up to it,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.78,0:06:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,capture it, cook it,\Nand eat it for lunch!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.52,0:06:57.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna eat it?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.26,0:07:00.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYou're right!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.52,0:07:01.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.12,0:07:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that a lighthouse?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.28,0:07:06.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now what's a lighthouse\Ndoing way out here?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.60,0:07:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if anyone lives there.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.53,0:07:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat's up?\NDo you see an island?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.67,0:07:12.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not really.\NIt's just a lighthouse.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.67,0:07:15.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's not enough there\Nfor the Log Pose to point to.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.37,0:07:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about the frog?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.40,0:07:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell us which way the frog went!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.14,0:07:19.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.33,0:07:22.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like the frog is headed to the\Nlighthouse.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.62,0:07:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frogs should be\Nmarinated in white wine
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.13,0:07:25.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to dissolve the mucus.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.24,0:07:27.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, you coat them with\Nflour and fry them up crisp.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.81,0:07:29.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.37,0:07:31.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the Captain says\Nwe're going after the frog,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:33.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we really don't have\Nmuch choice in the matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.92,0:07:35.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.85,0:07:38.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NLet's go! Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:39.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO, USOPP, and CHOPPER]\N– Aye, aye!\N– Aye, aye!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.42,0:07:41.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhy are you all\Ngoing along with this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:45.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO, USOPP, LUFFY and CHOPPER]\N– Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!\N– Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.48,0:07:51.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIt's flying!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.65,0:07:53.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quick! Don't let it get away!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.48,0:07:55.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get up ahead of it\Nand block its course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.49,0:08:00.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO, USOPP, LUFFY and CHOPPER]\N– Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!\N– Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.89,0:08:13.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess we ran\Nashore or something!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.18,0:08:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, Robin! Say something!\NAre you two okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.89,0:08:21.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.42,0:08:25.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[relieved]\NOh...\NThank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:27.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[bell clanging]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.76,0:08:30.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that sound?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.81,0:08:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:43.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[distance distant whistle]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.15,0:08:50.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, that sounds like a...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.49,0:09:01.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! Out here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.82,0:09:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NFull reverse! Right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.16,0:09:09.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn 180 degrees!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.20,0:09:30.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhoa! That was close!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.27,0:09:35.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThat hunk of\Nmetal's trying to kill us!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.24,0:09:36.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NIs it a ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.38,0:09:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! Something\Nthat big and heavy
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.28,0:09:40.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,shouldn't even\Nbe able to float!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.35,0:09:46.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what're you doing?!\NGet out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.26,0:09:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Froggy!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.26,0:10:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looked like it was spitting out smoke!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.38,0:10:35.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NPirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Granny! Granny!\NLook! We got pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.30,0:10:40.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NWhat?\NIzzat true, Chimney?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.56,0:10:42.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okey dokey then, in that case.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.43,0:10:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better bring Granny\Nthe Transponder Snail!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.21,0:10:49.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be big pain\Nif they call for help
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the marines show up.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.54,0:10:51.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.25,0:10:54.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NHere it is, Granny!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.69,0:10:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NUhm... hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.69,0:10:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.12,0:11:01.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you got the wrong number.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.66,0:11:03.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's totally drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NOh! Paille, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.80,0:11:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That stuff goes good with booze!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.57,0:11:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NMm-mm! Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:17.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My name's Chimney.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.10,0:11:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is our kitty cat, Gonbe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.20,0:11:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and that's Granny Kokoro.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You fellas wouldn't happen
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.17,0:11:25.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to be train robbers, would ya?\NWahahaha!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.11,0:11:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My name's Luffy and I'm\Ngonna be King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.98,0:11:28.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.55,0:11:29.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.42,0:11:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!\NI like you, you're funny!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.20,0:11:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, Chimney. That\Nthing's a steam boat, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.24,0:11:36.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems awfully long to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.77,0:11:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't imagine it getting very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:39.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.71,0:11:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've probably never\Nseen anything like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.54,0:11:44.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seeing as it's the\Nonly one in the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not a steam boat,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.16,0:11:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's a sea train\Ncalled the Puffing Tom.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.16,0:11:48.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHow does it work?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.86,0:11:50.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It uses a steam engine to turn
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.33,0:11:52.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,its paddlewheels\Nand run on a railway.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.87,0:11:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Railway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.73,0:11:57.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NUh-huh! If you look close,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.74,0:12:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can see the tracks\Nright below the waves.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.37,0:12:02.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The train goes the\Nsame route every day,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.34,0:12:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,taking people from\None island to the next.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.61,0:12:07.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It carries ships and packages and other\Nstuff, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.48,0:12:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, funny we\Ndidn't notice it before.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.02,0:12:11.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't you see the signal?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.35,0:12:13.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a bell\Nringing and everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.18,0:12:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How were we supposed to know?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.68,0:12:15.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if we couldn't figure it out
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.98,0:12:18.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then that frog sure\Nwouldn't get it, would he?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.55,0:12:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was awful rude of you to hit him like\Nthat.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.56,0:12:22.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were gonna catch him and cook him,\Nyou know.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.42,0:12:25.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you saw the frog?\NThat's Yokozuna.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.41,0:12:27.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHe sure was an awesome swimmer.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.11,0:12:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NEither way,\NI wouldn't worry about him,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.91,0:12:30.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's pretty tough.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.45,0:12:31.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, that\Nwasn't the first time
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's challenged\Nthe train and lost.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.68,0:12:35.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's really kind of a pain.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.05,0:12:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you want to see him again,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.12,0:12:38.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just hang around here\Nand I'm sure he'll pop up.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.09,0:12:39.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why he didn't run.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.62,0:12:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, I thought\Nthat frog was stupid,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.19,0:12:43.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it turns out he was\Njust being super manly.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.86,0:12:44.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NEasy for you to say!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.86,0:12:46.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to put up\Nwith him all the time!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.03,0:12:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't even count\Nhow many times
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's broken the rail guard.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And just imagine what it's like
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.04,0:12:54.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for the passengers when\Nhe slams into the train!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.20,0:12:55.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's pretty crazy.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.70,0:12:57.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, since that\Nfrog's a fighter like me,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna eat him after all!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.71,0:13:01.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who would want to eat that gross thing in\Nthe first place?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.01,0:13:05.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyways, after this, where're\Nyou folks headed off to?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.01,0:13:09.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea train runs to all sorts of places.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.80,0:13:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's the town of the\NSpring Queen, St. Poplar.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.04,0:13:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's the gourmet town, Pucci\Nor the Carnival town, San Faldo.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.91,0:13:20.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're all fun places to go.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if you happen to\Nwork for the government,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.65,0:13:23.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can take a special train
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.82,0:13:26.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that's even fancier than the Puffing Tom.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.23,0:13:27.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good, then that's the\Nplace we're gonna g...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.73,0:13:28.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.87,0:13:31.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but there's no reason\Nfor us to take the train
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.17,0:13:32.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when we have our own ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.50,0:13:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll just follow the log.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.70,0:13:35.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? Where's it pointing to?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.09,0:13:37.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should be someplace east of here.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.69,0:13:41.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. Well, in that case\Nit's Water Seven for sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.56,0:13:43.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The train you saw\Non the way here
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.13,0:13:46.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just came from\NBlue Station on that island.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.17,0:13:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They call it the City of Water.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.46,0:13:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got great shipyards.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.90,0:13:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You might say that's their claim to fame.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.96,0:13:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When it comes to boats,\Nthey're first class!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.60,0:13:56.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're always\Ncoming up with some
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.87,0:13:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,fancy new technology to build\Nboats for the World Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.00,0:14:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, then they must have\Nsome awesome shipwrights, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.68,0:14:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NSome? More like\Ndamn near all of 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.44,0:14:08.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,City's like a regular\Nshipwright's convention!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.94,0:14:10.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! You hear that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.54,0:14:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.82,0:14:13.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right then. It's settled!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.38,0:14:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna find the best\Nshipwright in Water Seven
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.35,0:14:16.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and get him to join our crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.78,0:14:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?\NIn that case, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.92,0:14:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Upsey-daisy, you can do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.33,0:14:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's she going?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.30,0:14:25.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.92,0:14:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got a present for ya.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.13,0:14:30.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a little map of the city and a\Nreference letter.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.68,0:14:32.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just give this to a\Nfella named Iceburg,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.84,0:14:35.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I promise he'll\Nfix yer ship up good.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.58,0:14:37.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven's a\Npretty confusing place,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.70,0:14:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,be sure not to get lost.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.83,0:14:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have a big\Nheart, don't you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.63,0:14:43.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We really owe you one!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.24,0:14:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NWe'll be heading\Nback to Water Seven soon,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.24,0:14:50.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so maybe we'll see you there.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.94,0:14:52.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NSounds like a plan to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.52,0:14:54.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if you like,\NI can even give you folks
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.29,0:14:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a tour of all my\Nfavorite drinkin' holes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.82,0:15:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds good! We'll try\Nto keep a look out for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.52,0:15:01.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll take 'bout a\Nweek for the Log
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.92,0:15:03.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to lock onto the next island,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.49,0:15:06.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so you'll have plenty of\Ntime to do some sightseeing!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.60,0:15:08.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGreat! Should be fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.54,0:15:13.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOkay! Everyone\Nready?! Time to set sail!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.41,0:15:14.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CREW]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for the map and reference\Nletter.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.72,0:15:19.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I sure am glad we\Nran into you on the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.57,0:15:26.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NHave a safe trip!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.54,0:15:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better keep an eye out
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.76,0:15:32.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for all those government\Ntypes down there!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.40,0:15:34.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYahoo! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.96,0:15:37.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,City of Meat, here we come!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.80,0:15:39.50,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NDid you forget\Nwhere we're going already?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.04,0:15:51.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhat a nice wind!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.74,0:15:52.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We might make it\Nout to Water Seven
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.01,0:15:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,even faster than I thought!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.88,0:15:56.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be happy either way!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.18,0:15:57.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NDon't worry\Nabout finding a shipwright.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.97,0:15:59.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got it all under control.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.47,0:16:01.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll get the hottest girl\Nin town, guaranteed.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.50,0:16:03.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do I care if\Nthe shipwright's hot?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.18,0:16:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want a huge, manly dude... like\Neven bigger than a bear!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.21,0:16:07.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,16 feet tall!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.48,0:16:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A guy that size couldn't\Neven fit on the ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.51,0:16:11.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And who knows how much\Nfood he would need to eat!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.65,0:16:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that matters is that he's good at his\Njob.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.27,0:16:15.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, the\Nreal problem's gonna be
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,finding someone crazy enough
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.11,0:16:19.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to go sailing with\Na bunch of pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.13,0:16:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.09,0:16:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad we're\Ngonna make a new friend!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.12,0:16:24.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're lucky we ran into that train station\Non the way.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.53,0:16:26.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This map should be a big help!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.50,0:16:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is\Nfollow Kokoro's directions
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.70,0:16:31.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to that Iceburg guy\Nand we're set!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.50,0:16:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.24,0:16:34.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid drunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.01,0:16:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, looks like Luffy's art.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.88,0:16:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's try to\Nfind a shipwright
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.38,0:16:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that looks\Nsomething like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.35,0:16:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I saw a guy like that, I'd run.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.11,0:16:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't just run,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.18,0:16:45.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd jump into the sea to get away from\Nthat freak.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.81,0:16:47.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he looks like he\Nmight be part-octopus,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.25,0:16:49.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so even that\Nmight not save me.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.36,0:16:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you have anything better to talk\Nabout?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.42,0:16:53.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOkay everybody, since\Nwe're gonna be at Water Seven
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.35,0:16:55.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for a whole week, let me\Ngive you your allowance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NOoh! Me first!\NMe first! Ah! Stop shoving!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.23,0:17:02.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sounds of arguing]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.28,0:17:06.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[LUFFY and USOPP]\N– Allowance! Allowance! Allowance!\N– Allowance! Allowance! Allowance!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.13,0:17:18.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhy're you hugging\Nthe ship, Usopp?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.03,0:17:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know all these tin plates\Nmight not look like much to you,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.44,0:17:23.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but they bring back a lot\Nof fond memories for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.38,0:17:25.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I almost hate to see them go,\Nbut it'll all be worth it
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.84,0:17:28.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if the Merry can finally\Nget the repairs she needs!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.11,0:17:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI feel the same way.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.91,0:17:31.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of her battle\Nscars like anyone else,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.88,0:17:32.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but she's taken a real beating
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.02,0:17:35.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since we've entered\Nthe Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.19,0:17:38.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The deck squeaks and we've got leaks\Npopping up everywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.36,0:17:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody wants to admit it,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.53,0:17:42.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but if we don't fix this soon,\Nwe're as good as sunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.10,0:17:43.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah, but even if\Nwe can't get a shipwright
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for the crew, we still\Nhave plenty of money!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.97,0:17:47.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can do more\Nthan just fix her;
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.24,0:17:48.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we can power her up, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.91,0:17:50.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOoh!\NThen let's get more cannons!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.92,0:17:53.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah! And a big statue!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.89,0:17:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHey, I think we're there.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.03,0:17:55.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.43,0:18:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHe's right!\NI can see Water Seven!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.14,0:18:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right men, time to row!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.14,0:18:06.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThe wind's enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.09,0:18:08.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't wear us out before we even get\Nthere.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.04,0:18:20.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lovely.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.01,0:18:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.02,0:18:31.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNobody told me\Nit was gonna be this cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.39,0:18:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhoa!\NCheck that thing out!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.86,0:18:41.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't know they made fountains that\Nbig!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:42.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,OHHH!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.96,0:18:45.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's nuts! I've never\Nseen anything like it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I thought the\Nsea train was a big deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.83,0:18:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, that's the station up front.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.37,0:18:54.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NMust be the same one\NKokoro was talking about.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.04,0:18:55.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still, I wonder\Nwhere the harbor's at?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.84,0:18:57.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inside the town, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:19:00.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FISHERMAN A]\NHey! Hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.51,0:19:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates shouldn't\Nsail in the front,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.07,0:19:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you gotta be more discreet!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.14,0:19:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Use the backstreet entrance\Nover there, instead!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.04,0:19:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOh, okay! Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.23,0:19:18.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Look,\Nthere's so many boats!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.07,0:19:22.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awesome! The city's floating!\NI wonder how it works?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.58,0:19:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NBut everything's\Nflooded everywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.35,0:19:35.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't all the buildings gonna be full of\Nwater, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.22,0:19:37.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not at all. The houses\Nhere were built
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.32,0:19:39.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with a submerged\Nfoundation in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:40.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.28,0:19:43.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you look beneath the walkway,\Nyou'll understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.19,0:19:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NYou're right!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.12,0:19:45.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like the city's\Nsitting on stilts!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.02,0:19:48.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. Certainly\Nlives up to its name.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.20,0:19:51.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up! Dock the ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.30,0:19:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.97,0:19:58.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you pirates think\Nyou're doing here in town?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.37,0:20:00.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not looking to\Nplunder, now are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.61,0:20:03.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh! We just wanna\Nget our ship repaired!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.33,0:20:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHe just asks that\Nlike it's no big deal?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.56,0:20:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case there's a\Nlittle cape just ahead of here.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.42,0:20:10.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anchor your ship\Nover there for now!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.57,0:20:12.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOkay!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.31,0:20:13.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThanks for the help!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.94,0:20:15.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThey keep waving us off.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.11,0:20:18.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NOf course they do.\NWe're flying a pirate flag.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.49,0:20:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NShould be okay\Nto anchor here, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.93,0:20:23.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NCan't see why not.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.16,0:20:25.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's certainly far enough from the city.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.21,0:20:27.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWorks for me! Furl the sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.47,0:20:35.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CREW cries out in surprise]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.35,0:20:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to\Nbreak the ship?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.11,0:20:40.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! All I did was pull\Nthe rope like I always do!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.25,0:20:45.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Holy crap! If the Merry's\Nfalling apart this easy
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.02,0:20:48.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we're lucky we\Nmade it here at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.76,0:20:51.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, they're not scared of pirates\Nhere, are they?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.23,0:20:52.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you think\Nthat's kinda strange?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.86,0:20:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's cause we're shipyard\Ncustomers just like anyone else.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.90,0:20:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop yapping and start fixing the ship\Nalready!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.64,0:21:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They probably aren't\Nconcerned about pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.17,0:21:02.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because they have enough\Nsecurity to deal with them
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.56,0:21:03.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if they misbehave.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.49,0:21:05.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bet there's plenty\Nof Marines here, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.23,0:21:06.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Comes with the territory, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.96,0:21:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What, are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.54,0:21:09.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean they're gonna\Nhave us arrested?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.01,0:21:11.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think\Nthat'll be a problem,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.14,0:21:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since we're paying\Ncustomers and all.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.06,0:21:14.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI guess so.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.29,0:21:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[LUFFY and USOPP]\N– Well, that settles it! We'll see you later!\N– Well, that settles it! We'll see you later!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.23,0:21:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on one minute, you two!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.53,0:21:20.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI need you to come with me
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.53,0:21:22.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to take care of some business.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.27,0:21:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What business?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.47,0:21:27.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First off, we're going to\Ntake Kokoro's reference letter
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.77,0:21:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to this Iceburg guy... assuming\Nwe can find him.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.21,0:21:31.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hopefully, he'll be\Nable to take care of
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.62,0:21:33.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Merry's repairs for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.21,0:21:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After that, we'll\Nhave to find a place
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.01,0:21:37.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,where we can trade in\Nour gold for some berries.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.18,0:21:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOkeydokey. Works for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.78,0:21:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.55,0:21:42.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go! To Water Seven!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.95,0:21:45.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOkay, but aren't\Nyou forgetting the gold?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.68,0:21:50.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN F]\NHey! Some pirates\Nare causing a ruckus at Dock #1!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.25,0:21:52.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN G]\NWhat?! That's not good!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.29,0:21:54.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN H]\NCome on!\NWe'd better go check this out!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.69,0:21:58.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NSorry, but you're\Nnot making any sense.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.23,0:21:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MIKAZUKI]\NNeed me\Nto talk slow for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.83,0:22:06.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soooooo you\Nrepaired our ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.37,0:22:09.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sooooo then I got to thinking.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.34,0:22:11.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And no matter\Nhow I looked at it,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.12,0:22:13.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,no matter how many times\NI turned our little deal
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.75,0:22:15.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,around in my head,\NI still felt like you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.79,0:22:18.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,were charging me way too much.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.16,0:22:20.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're interrupting our job.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.36,0:22:21.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MIKAZUKI]\NHere's the deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.50,0:22:24.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not paying a single\Nberry for the work you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:27.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MIKAZUKI CREW laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.14,0:22:30.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MIKAZUKI CREW A]\NThanks for\Nthe repairs, they were great!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.81,0:22:34.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MIKAZUKI CREW B]\NSo kind\Nof you to do them for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.99,0:22:46.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ICEBURG]\NMmwell... Kalifa.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.46,0:22:47.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.82,0:22:49.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KALIFA]\NYes, Mr. Iceburg.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.06,0:22:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those pirates are\NDock One customers.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.09,0:22:54.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But now that the work's done, they refuse\Nto pay.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.80,0:22:56.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sexual harassment.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.93,0:23:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mmwell. Maybe it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.02,0:23:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MIKAZUKI CREW laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.08,0:23:12.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, Sir, we take\Nour jobs very seriously.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.59,0:23:14.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not wise to mock our shipwrights like\Nthat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.64,0:23:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MIKAZUKI CREW A]\NCaptain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.04,0:23:32.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARPENTER A]\NOops. Sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.04,0:23:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.77,0:23:34.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch where you swing that thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.64,0:23:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just knocked out our... Ahh!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.98,0:23:40.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NOops. Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.75,0:23:43.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you punks\Ntrying to pick a fight?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.52,0:23:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.13,0:23:56.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.30,0:23:56.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We haven't had a chance to\Ntest fire that cannon, have we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:23:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aww! It looks like I missed\Nmy chance to go with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.43,0:23:58.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?! Can we\Ngo to a bookstore?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.94,0:24:00.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. Not yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.67,0:24:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.51,0:24:07.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.94,0:24:10.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll be back! Just wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.63,0:24:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're on shipwright turf.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.33,0:24:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is what\Nhappens when you try
Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.66,0:24:33.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NMaybe we should trade in\Nthe gold before anything else.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.09,0:24:35.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's boring. I wanna\Ngo to the shipyard.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.46,0:24:36.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It might not matter to you,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.56,0:24:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I'd feel nervous\Nwalking around a crowded city,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.70,0:24:41.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dragging a giant bag of treasure behind\Nme.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.03,0:24:43.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we trade it, we'll still\Nbe dragging berries around.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.60,0:24:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know, but it'll\Nbe a lot smaller,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.07,0:24:46.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so people won't\Nnotice it as much.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.83,0:24:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, what if we\Nrun into thieves?!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.73,0:24:50.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHa! We are thieves!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.76,0:24:53.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's true\Nbut if we cash it in,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.07,0:24:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you won't be the only\None carrying the money.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.13,0:24:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.64,0:25:00.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's almost like you don't\Nwant me taking care of the gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.15,0:25:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep! Only you could\Nlose that much gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.88,0:25:04.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He already forgot it once today.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.98,0:25:07.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou guys don't\Ntrust me, your own captain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.75,0:25:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI and USOPP]\N– Nope!\N– Nope!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.84,0:25:10.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAwww... Hey, that\Nreally hurts my feelings!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.91,0:25:12.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know if\NI can keep sailing
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.88,0:25:15.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with a crew that...\NWait, what's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.31,0:25:16.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHuh. That's funny.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.74,0:25:19.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that the only entrance to the city?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.58,0:25:21.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's a rental bull shop?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.31,0:25:22.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NBeats me.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.28,0:25:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Obviously they must\Nrent out something.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.48,0:25:25.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what's a bull?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.78,0:25:28.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno like a bulldog?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.72,0:25:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.00,0:25:32.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NExcuse me!\NWe'd like to rent some bulls!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.59,0:25:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find out what they are first!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.49,0:25:37.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHOP MAN A]\NHi, looking\Nfor some bulls, you said?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.66,0:25:38.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many people?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.60,0:25:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got three.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.50,0:25:40.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHOP MAN A]\NWhat kind would you like?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.68,0:25:44.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's three ranks.\N"Yagara," "Rabuka," and "King."
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.07,0:25:44.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For your little group,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.01,0:25:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking two\NYagaras will do just fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.54,0:25:49.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gimme one rare\Nand one well-done.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.41,0:25:51.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know what\Nyou're saying, do you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.70,0:25:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHOP MAN A]\NOh? You\Nfollowed a Log to get here?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.44,0:25:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYep!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.39,0:25:56.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHOP MAN A]\NThat's quite an achievement,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.26,0:25:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but if you're not\Nfrom around here,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.46,0:25:59.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this is probably the first\Ntime you've heard about bulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.17,0:26:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.40,0:26:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHOP MAN A]\NWell, to make a\Nlong story short there they are!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.43,0:26:05.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yagara bulls, you can\Nfind them all over town.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.16,0:26:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As you can see, it's a\Ntype of fish that swims
Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.76,0:26:10.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with its head above the water.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.19,0:26:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since the whole city is flooded,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.83,0:26:14.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we have a lot more\Ncanals than walkways.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.20,0:26:16.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because of that,\Npretty much everyone
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.03,0:26:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,here uses the bulls\Nin their daily life.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.28,0:26:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you want to go sightseeing,\Nyou'll need one too.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.08,0:26:23.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So they use the bulls to pull those little\Nboats?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.06,0:26:25.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, the boat part's\Nmounted on their back.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.56,0:26:27.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words,\Nit's not much different
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.42,0:26:29.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,than riding\Nhorseback on land.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.79,0:26:33.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take a look\Nat the bullpen over there
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.82,0:26:36.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if you want to pick one out.\NThey don't bite.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.89,0:26:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll be 2,000 berries for\Ntwo two-passenger Yagaras.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.88,0:26:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThey're cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.01,0:26:46.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They even look like horses!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.12,0:26:49.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh! That's gross! What's\Nwrong with you, horse fish?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.84,0:26:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! Since that one seems to like\Nyou, I'll mount him for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.18,0:27:01.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he all right\Ncarrying heavy stuff?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.53,0:27:03.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, these guys are built for power.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.27,0:27:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The people here use them for moving all\Nthe time.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.84,0:27:08.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a big bag.\NCan I ask what's inside?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.68,0:27:09.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGold.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.77,0:27:13.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a good one. Well,\Nwhatever it is, it'll be okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.58,0:27:14.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.08,0:27:15.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Gimme!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.28,0:27:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.37,0:27:18.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess he thought it was worth asking,\Nat least.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.38,0:27:20.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is why I said I don't trust you with\Nthe money!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.72,0:27:23.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had to show him...\NHe didn't believe me!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.13,0:27:25.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, I sure wasn't expecting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.24,0:27:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.44,0:27:28.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that'll be one million berries\Nfor the two Yagara bulls.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.97,0:27:30.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't try to change the price on us!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.34,0:27:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speaking of gold, do you know where we can\Nget ours cashed in?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.51,0:27:35.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well there's quite a few places,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.62,0:27:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you'd probably\Nclean them all out trying
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.98,0:27:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to trade in that much\Ntreasure in one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.15,0:27:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I were you,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.25,0:27:43.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd check out downtown\Non the shipbuilding island.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.40,0:27:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not really familiar with the area.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.18,0:27:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think you could give us some directions?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.11,0:27:48.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's right over there.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.95,0:27:49.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, take this.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.98,0:27:52.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! A map!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.50,0:27:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.75,0:27:56.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, we can find a\Nshipyard downtown too, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.59,0:27:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep! Best one in the world!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.01,0:28:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That'll be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.25,0:28:01.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can head straight
Dialogue: 50,0:28:01.22,0:28:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to the shipyard soon\Nas we trade in our gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.23,0:28:05.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well you're not gonna\Nhear any complaints from me.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.06,0:28:07.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as the Merry\Ngets repaired, I'll be happy!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.20,0:28:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we'll find a shipwright.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.57,0:28:10.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I can't wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.90,0:28:11.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:11.58,0:28:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.55,0:28:15.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Go Yagara!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.92,0:28:16.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHOP MAN A]\NSee you later!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.30,0:28:20.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your business and have a safe\Ntrip!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.33,0:28:26.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDowntown,\Nfull speed ahead! Yahoo!
